<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink178-kilavi">
       talaimakaṉ tōḻiyai irantu kuṟaiyuṟuvāṉ colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
          Spoken by the hero, having begged the confidante, as one who has a request.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink178">
<l>tōḷuṅ kūntalum palapā rāṭṭi</l>
<l>vāḻta lollumō maṟṟē ceṅkōṟ</l>
<l>kuṭṭuvaṉ ṟoṇṭi yaṉṉa</l>
<l>veṟkaṇṭu nayantunī nalkāk kālē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>When you do not care [for me] with desire,</l>
        <l>Even [after] seeing me [= my suffering), like</l>
        <l>Toṇṭi of Kuttuvaṉ with a just sceptre,</l>
        <l>Is it possible to live [on], [by only] praising several [times]</l>
        <l>[Your] shoulders and [your] tresses?</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
